	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Board-edge port land for a simulator - not a connector. Generated for a 1.6 mm substrate (er 4.5). Pad 1 is the 2.95 mm signal pad the solver drives, the width of the 50 ohm line; pad 2 is the solid ground pad directly under it on B.Cu, so the port has reference copper whether or not the zones are filled. No coplanar ground beside the line, so the line stays a microstrip and a microstrip (MSL) port is the right model."
	)
